    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "batho ba palo nnyane",
      "rationale": "מתי מספר — palo e nnyane ya batho, lebai la go bala le le hlalosago."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme ba baleletšego tšhoša ba tla boa go tšwa lefasing la Mitsrayime ba ya lefasing la Yehuda, batho ba palo nnyane; gomme ba tla tseba ba sa humanegago ka moka ba Yehuda ba ba tlilego lefasing la Mitsrayime go nna moo, lentšu la mang le tla ema — la ka, goba la bona.",
